We suggest use of bear for making compilation database json file. This will help the source_refactor tool to
make use of compilation information for large projects to use it in its own parsing procedure.

Usage: bear <compilation command>
Eg. bear make

testrun.sh will compile the source_refactor tool, run that tool on $1 and dump the refactored code in $2 file.
It will then compile $2 with memhook library which contains the runtime memory allocation analysis code.
a.out is the executable which is generated.

